    will be triggered by keyboard widget\r\ninstr 1\r\nkEnv madsr .1, .2, .6, .4\r\naOut
    vco2 p5, p4\r\nouts aOut*kEnv, aOut*kEnv\r\nendin\r\n\r\n</CsInstruments>\r\n<CsScore>\r\n;causes
    Csound to run for about 7000 years...\r\nf0 z\r\n</CsScore>\r\n</CsoundSynthesizer>\r\n"
